  "notes": "{濃|こ}い is an i-adjective meaning \"thick,\" \"dense,\" \"dark\" (color), or \"strong\" (flavor). It describes high concentration or intensity.\n\nFORMS:\n- Adverbial: {濃|こ}く\n- Noun form: {濃|こ}さ (thickness, density)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {濃|こ}い{味|あじ}: strong/rich flavor\n- {濃|こ}いコーヒー: strong coffee\n- {濃|こ}い{色|いろ}: dark color\n- {化粧|けしょう}が{濃|こ}い: heavy makeup\n- {関係|かんけい}が{濃|こ}い: close relationship\n\nCONTRAST:\n- {濃|こ}い: thick, dense, strong, dark\n- {薄|うす}い: thin, light, weak, pale\n\nUSAGE: Can describe physical properties (density, color) or abstract qualities (relationships, experiences).",
